{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19002","headline":"八月十五日夜半云开然後翫月因书一时之景寄呈乐天 · 刘禹锡","name":"八月十五日夜半云开然後翫月因书一时之景寄呈乐天","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"半夜碧云收，中天素月流。\n开城邀好客，置酒赏清秋。\n影透衣香润，光凝歌黛愁。\n斜辉犹可翫，移宴上西楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}